flowchart TD
  S([START]) --> SUP[1 Supervisor<br/>intent classification]
  SUP -->|generate / what-if / repair| REQ[2 Requirements agent<br/>capacity proof]
  SUP -->|view, validate, explain,<br/>move, compare, export...| ACT[8 Action agent]
  SUP -->|free-form question| AST[9 ReAct assistant<br/>all 30 MCP tools]
  REQ -->|ok| SCH[3 Scheduler agent]
  REQ -.->|missing info| EXP
  SCH --> VAL[4 Validator agent]
  VAL -->|unplaced and progress| DIA[5 Diagnoser]
  DIA --> REP[6 Repairer]
  REP --> VAL
  VAL -->|valid or stalled| APP{{7 Approval gate<br/>interrupt - human}}
  VAL -.->|error| EXP
  APP --> EXP[10 Explainer]
  ACT --> EXP
  EXP --> RES[11 Respond]
  AST --> RES
  RES --> E([END])
